    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Hey, Emily! You're doing good? I just had a rough time with some work stuff. How about you? \ud83d\ude0a",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:07:39.793814+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear about your work stuff. I wish you the best with it! \ud83d\ude14",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:08:32.608787+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's good to hear. I wish you the best with it!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:09:03.323086+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks, that's very kind of you. I know how work can be and it's good to hear someone cares. \ud83d\ude0f",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:11:51.944496+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's really nice of you, Emily. I can only imagine how hard it is to have a job that isn't really fulfilling or paying well.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:12:29.921162+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, it's really tough sometimes. But I'm grateful to have someone who understands.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:16:49.687599+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I can only imagine how hard it must be to work for a job that doesn't really provide you with the satisfaction or earnings you hope for. It's not uncommon for people in all walks of life to feel this way at some point or another.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:19:55.665961+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I understand that. It's definitely frustrating to see so many people struggling with the same issues I do. But at least we have someone who truly understands what it\u2019s like to feel unmotivated and undervalued.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-06T11:25:13.080647+00:00"
    }
